<title>DENMARK: Oresundskonsortiet ups 4-pct bond to 800 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Oresundskonsortiet ups 4-pct bond to 800 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Danish-Swedish Oresund bridge and tunnel consortium, Oresundskonsortiet, said on Wednesday it was increasing to 800 million crowns from 500 million an existing four-percent bond due 2002.</p>
<p>--Ole Mikkelsen +45 33969650</p>
</text>
